  "description": "The Firmstrong Urban Lady Three Speed cruiser bike is a fantastic recreational women’s bike that perfectly blends classic style with the added versatility of gears. True to the timeless beach cruiser design, the frame is simple, clean, and elegant, offering a beautiful aesthetic that makes every ride feel special.\n\nWhat makes the Urban Lady 3-Speed a standout is the Shimano internal gear system. This is widely considered one of the easiest gear systems to operate, making it perfect for riders who want more capability without the complexity. Because all shifting takes place inside the rear hub, the chain never has to move between sprockets. This results in a smooth, low-maintenance ride with far fewer mechanical headaches or messy adjustments. You can even change gears seamlessly without interrupting your pedal stroke.\n\nWhile it features only three gears, each one is precision-tuned for a specific riding need. Gear one offers very little resistance, making it ideal for tackling hills with ease. Gear two provides a moderate, sustainable pace for cruising between 5 and 15 mph. Gear three offers the highest resistance, allowing you to hit higher speeds of 15 to 25 mph on flat straightaways or downhill paths. With only one cable for the entire system, the design remains uncluttered and easy to manage.\n\nThe ride is exceptionally smooth and effortless. Our signature wide tires and dual-spring saddle absorb the shock from bumps in the road, ensuring your journey is soft and comfortable. For stopping, we have kept the classic coaster brake system; simply pedal backwards to stop, just like the original beach cruisers. Built with a durable steel frame and a lady-friendly step-through design, the Urban Lady 3-Speed is the ultimate upgrade for the casual rider who wants to explore more terrain with total confidence.\n\n15” Steel Frame with 26” Aluminum Wheels\n\n3 Speed Womens Bike with Shimano Internal Gear System, shifts quickly, easily, and requires little maintenance\n\nDual Spring Oversized Seat for Added Comfort\n\n2.125” Wide White-Wall Tires provides a cushioned, relaxed ride for easy rolling\n\n28.5” Wide Cruiser Bike Handlebars with Hi-Density Foam Grips\n\nBicycle Weighs 34.5 lbs. Fully Assembled\n\nFits Most Women 5’2\" – 5’11\" Tall\n\nRecommended Riding Speed 3 – 15mph\n\nRecommended Riding Distance 0 – 20 miles in a single trip\n\nThe Seat and Handlebar Height and Tilt can be adjusted to properly fit the rider\n\nColor Matched Fenders can be Purchased Separately for $49.99.\n\nBike comes 85% Assembled, Assembly is easy and fun!\n\nDesigned in Hermosa Beach, CA",
